      "description": "The 5,280-square-foot lot, 44 feet wide and running through 120 feet to Lily Alley, held a recently restored, empty single-family Victorian house of twelve rooms with 14-foot ceilings, under review for landmark designation, with a fenced seven-car lot behind it on Lily.",
